# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
.nomedia

# Godot-specific ignores
.import/
export.cfg
export_credentials.cfg
*.tmp

# Imported translations (automatically generated from CSV files)
*.translation

# Mono-specific ignores
.mono/
data_*/
mono_crash.*.json

pr-description.md
pre-commit.txt
pre-push.txt
logs_*.zip

# Common staging / backup artifacts.
#
# The LLM harness checks these patterns at two layers:
#   1. lint-llm.ps1 / run-llm-hooks.ps1 -AutoFix call
#      `Get-LlmStagingArtifacts` (tracked + non-ignored) on this
#      checked-against list. Tracked files matching these patterns FAIL
#      the lint; the AutoFix path deletes them.
#   2. The broader cleanup set used by the AutoFix path and
#      `Get-LlmStrayWorkingTreeArtifacts` ALSO covers editor junk
#      (`*.swp`, `*.swo`, `*~`, `.#*`, `#*#`, `.DS_Store`, `Thumbs.db`).
#      Those are NOT all listed here so they appear as untracked rather
#      than ignored, which lets the linter flag them via the standard
#      `--others --exclude-standard` path. The `*.tmp` pattern above IS
#      gitignored (Godot 4 convention); `Get-LlmStrayWorkingTreeArtifacts`
#      uses `git ls-files --ignored` to find those anyway, closing the
#      blind spot where a stale `*.tmp` corrupts the working tree but
#      is invisible to the standard listing.
*.new
*.bak
*.orig
*.old
*.rej
